      "content": "PICCOTT'S END 1. 5252                                             (West Side)                                                  No 99 TL 0508 3/215 II                       GV 2. Early to mid C19.  Whitewashed stucco and brick, Welsh slated roof with paired bracketted eaves.  2 storeys, L plan.  South elevation has 2 sash windows with glazing bars, east elevation lst floor sash windows, ground floor modern casement window.  Included for group value. Nos 95 to 105 (odd) form a group. Listing NGR: TL0528208885"
